{"name": "We Build Cabins", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD LOG CABINS IN THE WILDERNESS</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/dc1e40a935391cfa38544f7fa9172aa0.poster.avif?t=1787825451\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/dc1e40a935391cfa38544f7fa9172aa0.webm?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/dc1e40a935391cfa38544f7fa9172aa0.mp4?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head into the mountains with your friends and build log cabins far from roads and the noise of the city. Just pines, fresh air, an axe in your hand and a blueprint of the house you're there to build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MASTER THE FULL WOODWORKING PROCESS</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/87d83f03ef8f9bdae01acce297e55ebb.poster.avif?t=1787825451\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/87d83f03ef8f9bdae01acce297e55ebb.webm?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/87d83f03ef8f9bdae01acce297e55ebb.mp4?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every cabin begins in the forest. Fell trees, carry and sort the trunks, strip away the bark, cut logs to size and mill timber into boards. Prepare every part yourself, then assemble the walls, floors and roof according to the blueprint.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD TOGETHER</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/229f4675eb12b9ad9623b25cd12816a4.poster.avif?t=1787825451\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/229f4675eb12b9ad9623b25cd12816a4.webm?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/229f4675eb12b9ad9623b25cd12816a4.mp4?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every pair of hands counts. Split the jobs between your friends. Let one fell the trees, another work the logs, a third haul materials to the site. There's work for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UPGRADE YOUR TOOLS AND AUTOMATE PRODUCTION</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/5426c4385d5ea67ac9fdd06d7cf484cb.poster.avif?t=1787825451\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/5426c4385d5ea67ac9fdd06d7cf484cb.webm?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/5426c4385d5ea67ac9fdd06d7cf484cb.mp4?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin with simple hand tools and demanding physical work. Upgrade your equipment, expand the workshop and build machines to automate the work, so you can take on bigger, more interesting and more valuable contracts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DON'T FORGET TO REST</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/dbc4e73df2e0b9611dc93615e9b20360.poster.avif?t=1787825451\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/dbc4e73df2e0b9611dc93615e9b20360.webm?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/extras/dbc4e73df2e0b9611dc93615e9b20360.mp4?t=1787825451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The forest is more than a workplace. Fish in the evening, gather mushrooms beneath the trees, cook together, heat the sauna or sit beside the fire and play the guitar. A well-rested crew works better!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A co-op simulator about building wooden houses in the Canadian wilderness. Fell trees, saw logs, strip the bark and raise homes by blueprint. The locals are already waiting for you to take on their orders!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556530/4fdd4800088a9f539c8579b55a7955a7e1d7fd0b/header.jpg?t=1787825451", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Co-op", "Simulation", "Job Simulator", "Relaxing", "First-Person", "Immersive Sim"], "developers": "Project Zima", "publishers": "Project Zima", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4556530", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/EzOovEgkm3w", "first_seen": 1787781600.0, "review_rank": 36}